{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40901","headline":"宿顾城二首 一 · 张直","name":"宿顾城二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿草展青裀，樾影连春树。\n茅屋八九家，农器六七具。\n主人有好怀，搴衣留我住。\n春酒新泼醅，香美连糟滤。\n一醉卧花阴，明朝送君去。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张直","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}